 "summary": "CreateDXGIFactory and the walk UnityPlayer makes with the factory (RVA 0x520700; game run 38206263976 seq 3298-3301): EnumAdapters to its end, each adapter's EnumOutputs to its end, the outputs' and adapters' descriptions, Release. On the runners, which have no GPU: two Microsoft Basic Render Driver adapters (0x1414, 0x8C), no dedicated memory, 8,587,180,032 bytes shared; the first with one output, \\\\.\\DISPLAY1 at 0,0-1024,768 on the primary monitor; DXGI_ERROR_NOT_FOUND past each end; E_NOINTERFACE for another interface, E_POINTER for a NULL out pointer; every object new with one reference. Version 0.2.0 (Sprint 065): IDXGIOutput::GetDisplayModeList, which UnityPlayer RVA 0xdc5084 calls next: 13 modes for six formats under any flags; for R8G8B8A8_UNORM under flags 0 and SCALING, 640x480 to 1920x1080 at 64/1 Hz, progressive, scaling unspecified (the 13 resolutions game run 38216081440's unity.log prints); DXGI_ERROR_MORE_DATA for a short buffer, DXGI_ERROR_INVALID_CALL for a NULL count.",
